  "content": "<p>本模组是Vazkii创作的药水指环(Potion Fingers)的重制版</p>\n<p>原版模组：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/potion-fingers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/potion-fingers</a></p>\n<p>需要Fabric版本？请点击<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/potion-ring-reforged-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">此处</a></p>\n<p>我非常喜欢原版模组，但遗憾其未更新适配新版Minecraft，因此重制了这个版本。</p>\n<p>本重制版采用全新API，Minecraft 1.16.5-1.21.1版本需要依赖<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a>模组</p>\n<p><strong>戒指展示</strong><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/301/2025-03-23_15.png\"></p>\n<p><strong>效果叠加系统</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/293/2025-03-23_13-51-48-png.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/294/2025-03-23_13-52-24-png.png\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>合成配方</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/302/2025-03-23_15.png\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/303/2025-03-23_15.png\"></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/304/2025-03-23_15.png\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><strong>自定义戒指</strong></p>\n<p><br>在药水戒指重制版2.0中，您可以创建带有模组特效的自定义戒指。</p>\n<p>查看Wiki了解如何制作自定义戒指：<a href=\"https://github.com/Samlegamer/PotionRingReforged/wiki/How-to-create-a-custom-ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Samlegamer/PotionRingReforged/wiki/How-to-create-a-custom-ring</a><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/326/2025-03-15_14.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/size-shifting-potions\" rel=\"nofollow\">Size Shifting Potions</a>的兼容性整合</strong>（1.19.2及以上版本）<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1135/292/2025-03-23_15-27-54-png.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Curios模组</strong>：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Craft Tweaker支持：</p>\n<p>戒指不再使用标签系统，现在所有戒指都是独立物品。<br>简单示例：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span>craftingTable.addShaped(\"我的自定义合成\", </span><span>item:potionring:ring_of_regeneration</span><span>, </span></p>\n<p><span>[ [</span><span>item:minecraft:nether_star</span><span>, </span><span>item:minecraft:ghast_tear</span><span>, </span><span>item:minecraft:air</span><span>], </span></p>\n<p><span>[</span><span>item:minecraft:ghast_tear</span><span>, </span><span>item:potionring:potion_ring</span><span>, </span><span>item:minecraft:ghast_tear</span><span>], </span></p>\n<p><span>[</span><span>item:minecraft:air</span><span>, </span><span>item:minecraft:ghast_tear</span><span>, </span><span>item:minecraft:air</span><span>]]);</span></p>",
